# AM01 Web Dashboard Server Configuration
#
# Read by odo-webd.service. Only WEBD_OPTS has any effect; the user and binary
# path are literal in the unit file (systemd cannot take those from the
# environment). The binary is /usr/bin/odo-webd, running as 'miner'.
#
# Reach it at http://BOARD_IP:8080/

# Command-line options:
#   -p PORT   HTTP port (default 8080)
#   -f PATH   Frontend assets directory (optional)
#   -S PATH   Status file written by odo-miner
WEBD_OPTS="-p 8080 -S /run/odod/status.json"
